  "bodyHash": "dcd06a2e4875cef3",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UWsTm2svK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" alt=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1320/856/smartstreamlabs-discord-png.png\" width=\"359\" height=\"105\"></a></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">全新的 Discord 服务器！用于私人支持与更新通知。</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\">探索</span> <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>密室之城</strong></span>, <span style=\"color:#fff\">一座神秘的大型结构</span> <span style=\"color:#fff\">充满试炼与宝藏。受标志性的末地城启发，密室之城是一座堡垒般的建筑，内含独特房间与丰厚奖励的挑战，旨在考验最勇敢的冒险者。</span> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/612/ixfa.png\" alt=\"icon\" width=\"94\" height=\"94\"></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">兼容并<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" rel=\"nofollow\">必需</a>：</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lootr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lootr (Forge &amp; NeoForge)</a> &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/620/637473842688195004.png\" alt=\"lootr\" width=\"109\" height=\"109\"></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">推荐：<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/784/qwxa.png\" alt=\"head\" width=\"85\" height=\"85\"></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stackable127\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stackable127</a></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sophisticated-backpacks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sophisticated Backpacks</a></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/990/499/f0d24b750c946ed2b75ad009167e1d18c0848b39.webp\" alt=\"neo\" width=\"343\" height=\"117\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Fabric 1.21.8 + 计划中。</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">NeoForge 1.21.8 + 计划中。</span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;font-size:28px;text-align:center\">不支持 Forge 1.21 或更高版本。</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">别忘了在我的主页上查看我的其他模组！</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/623/icon54.png\" alt=\"notes\" width=\"608\" height=\"163\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">战利品生成：</span>所有宝箱都包含丰厚的战利品，并在加载区块时同步加载。</span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">结构生成：</span>密室之城生成于高度 100 以上</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/603/minecraft_neoforge__1.png\" alt=\"the city\" width=\"2151\" height=\"1095\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/737/tricky_trials_logo.webp\" alt=\"tricky trials\" width=\"1123\" height=\"318\"></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>多层塔楼</strong></span>：城市由多个层级组成，每个层级都包含一个<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>试炼室</strong></span>，拥有不同的主题、怪物和挑战。楼层各不相同，让游戏体验充满刺激和不可预测性。</span></h1>\n</li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/952/389/trial_spawner_je4_be3.webp\" alt=\"trial\" width=\"146\" height=\"146\"></span>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">依靠试炼刷怪笼进行防御！</span></h1>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/786/mace.webp\" alt=\"mace\" width=\"171\" height=\"171\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">清空塔楼并获得 2倍重锤！</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/787/breeze.webp\" alt=\"breeze\" width=\"185\" height=\"185\"></span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">在塔楼中对抗 Minecraft 生物：沼泽骷髅、旋风人等！</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/788/bogged2.webp\" alt=\"bogged\" width=\"240\" height=\"475\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1013/610/minecraft_neoforge__1.png\" alt=\"room\" width=\"2171\" height=\"1084\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/868/313/intellij-idea-icon-512x512-ksbwsbbn.png\" alt=\"intelij\" width=\"512\" height=\"512\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">本模组使用 IntelliJ 开发</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>免责声明：本模组非 Minecraft 官方产品，未获 Mojang 或微软批准或认可。</h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
